      "name": "Mf.DP.tendsto_poissonFixedEpochPrivacyVariance_div_leadingTerm_one",
      "typeText": "∀ (epoch : ℕ) (epoch_pos : 0 < epoch) (sensitivity epsilon delta : ℝ),\n  0 < sensitivity →\n    0 ≤ epsilon →\n      0 < delta →\n        delta < 1 - Real.exp (-↑epoch) →\n          Filter.Tendsto\n            (fun extra =>\n              Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochCalibratedPrivacyVariance\n                  (Mf.DP.PoissonFixedEpochPoint.ofExtra epoch epoch_pos extra) sensitivity epsilon delta /\n                Mf.DP.fixedParticipationPrivacyVarianceLeadingTerm (↑epoch)\n                  (↑(Mf.DP.PoissonFixedEpochPoint.ofExtra epoch epoch_pos extra).samplingRate) sensitivity)\n            Filter.atTop (nhds 1)",
