      "typeText": "∀ (epoch : ℕ) (epoch_pos : 0 < epoch) (sensitivity epsilon delta : ℝ),\n  0 < sensitivity →\n    0 ≤ epsilon →\n      0 < delta →\n        delta < 1 - Real.exp (-↑epoch) →\n          ∀ᶠ (extra : ℕ) in Filter.atTop,\n            ∀ (energy : ℝ),\n              0 ≤ energy →\n                Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochTotalAverageVariance (Mf.DP.PoissonFixedEpochPoint.fullBatch epoch epoch_pos)\n                    sensitivity epsilon delta energy <\n                  Mf.DP.poissonFixedEpochTotalAverageVariance\n                    (Mf.DP.PoissonFixedEpochPoint.ofExtra epoch epoch_pos extra) sensitivity epsilon delta energy",
