      "id": "propagation",
      "name": "Mf.DP.fixedEpochCenterGap_pos_of_boundary_nonneg",
      "typeText": "∀ (point : Mf.DP.PoissonFixedEpochPoint) (h boundary query : ℝ),\n  point.epoch < point.horizon →\n    0 < h →\n      0 ≤ boundary →\n        boundary < query → 0 ≤ Mf.DP.fixedEpochCenterGap point h boundary → 0 < Mf.DP.fixedEpochCenterGap point h query",
